Rockchip RK3588 Overlay Notes
=============================

This directory contains DT overlays (.dtbo) for RK3588 boards.

CM5-CC overlays
---------------

- rk3588-opicm5-cc-usb-net.dtbo
	Keep USB host data paths enabled for USB Wi-Fi/Ethernet dongles.

- rk3588-opicm5-cc-lcd.dtbo
	Enable DSI LCD + touch panel path.

- rk3588-opicm5-cc-audio-es8388.dtbo
	Enable ES8388 audio path.

- rk3588-opicm5-cc-pcie2x1l2.dtbo
	Enable PCIe2x1 lane2 host controller.

- rk3588-opicm5-cc-wireless-sdio.dtbo
	Optional: enable onboard SDIO WLAN/BT path.

- rk3588-uart2-m1.dtbo
	Enable UART2 with M1 pinmux and disable fiq_debugger.

Default template
----------------

See rk3588-opicm5-cc-default-overlays.txt for a ready-to-copy template
that can be merged into boot environment configuration (for example,
orangepiEnv.txt).

Typical usage uses overlay_prefix and overlays entries, e.g.:

	overlay_prefix=rk3588
	overlays=opicm5-cc-usb-net

The selected overlays remain editable in the image and can be changed
without rebuilding the kernel image.
